# On Home, alice's other device asks the agent for a card (e2e/fake: card:): the card waits for alice, so the core says
# to show a notice (wait); the app takes it (notice.claim) and the system shows it, its chat's (its tag). Tapped, the
# chat opens over Home at the card, which flashes; its notification is gone; back, Home.
timeout 90000
until 端到端测试
log do: peer send 通知测试 {T} card:要不要发通知 {T}|发 {T}|不发 {T}
timeout 150000
noticed 要不要发通知 {T}
shot 1-home
timeout 30000
notice 要不要发通知 {T}
until =发 {T}
shot 2-flash
nonotice 要不要发通知 {T}
shot 3-chat
log do: reads
back
until 端到端测试
shot 4-home
